  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Focus HEX Soft is the more elastic and comfortable version of Focus Hex, offering approximately 8% greater elasticity while preserving the six-sided geometry, strong snapback and high spin potential of the original. High-tech additives support excellent control, durability and tension stability. Independent testing has highlighted its power, control, touch, spin and value, while laboratory measurements have also shown strong energy return and reduced tension loss. It is particularly well suited to advanced baseline players who generate high racquet-head speed and heavy spin.",

    "zh": "MSV Focus HEX Soft 是 Focus Hex 的更柔和、更有弹性的版本，官方表示其弹性相比标准 Focus Hex 提升约 8%，同时保留六边形截面、强 Snap-back 以及高旋转潜力。高科技添加剂进一步提升控制、耐久和保磅表现。第三方测试对它的力量、控制、手感、旋转和性价比评价都非常突出，实验室数据也显示它拥有优秀的能量回馈和较低张力损失。非常适合技术成熟、挥拍速度快并大量使用上旋的高级底线球员。"
  },

